@startuml 007-question-settings-sequence
title 007 question-settings：時序圖（設定雙倍並計分）

actor "老師" as T
actor "第1組" as A
participant "app.py" as App
participant "Activity" as Act
participant "views" as V
participant "results" as R
participant "ClassicBuzzRule" as Rule

T -> App : POST /api/teacher/question-settings {question: 2, multiplier: 2}
App -> Act : set_question(2, 2)
Act -> Act : 檢查 preparing、題號、倍率 in {1, 2}
Act -> Act : attrs[2] = QuestionAttrs(2)、version+1
App --> T : {question: 2, multiplier: 2}
App -> V : 所有連線 view：questions[2].multiplier = 2、score_label = 得分
App --> A : 推播（第 2 題標「雙倍分數」）

== 搶答與結束（同 003） ==
App -> V : student_view(第1組) 加 results
V -> R : build(activity)
R -> Rule : rank(第 2 題送出, judgments, attrs[2])
Rule --> R : 得主 score = 2
R --> V : results、team_scores
App --> A : 推播 ended
@enduml
